<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Honam Petrochemical Q2 net falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Honam Petrochemical Q2 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)		     303    vs	 479</p>
<p>    Net			    9.66    vs     15.29</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	 11.21    vs     18.84</p>
<p>    Turnover		   286.38    vs    262.34</p>
<p>Note - Full Name is Honam Petrochemical Ltd. The figures were provided by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5647</p>
</text>
